{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112875","id":3016144390,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zxrYG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112875","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112875.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112875.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112875","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112875/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112875/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112875/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c55d717dffd4b1330766e2897e7ecb9ed9288419","number":112875,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add stepOut request support to Debug Adapter Protocol server","user":{"login":"adparker","id":72405,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker","html_url":"https://github.com/adparker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adparker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nAdds `stepOut` request handler to the DAP server, enabling external clients to step out of functions during debugging.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nPR #97758 added step-out functionality to the editor debugger in Godot 4.6, making it easy to extend the Debug Adapter Protocol (DAP) server with the step-out capability as well. This will allow users of external DAP clients (Neovim, Zed, etc.) to utilize step-out.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n  - Added `req_stepOut()` declaration to `debug_adapter_parser.h`\r\n  - Added `req_stepOut()` implementation to `debug_adapter_parser.cpp`\r\n  - Registered `stepOut` command handler in `debug_adapter_parser.cpp`\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\n\r\nFollows the pattern used by `req_next()` (step over) and `req_stepIn()` (step into). The implementation bridges the step-out DAP request to the existing debug_out() method added in #97758. \r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nManually tested with custom scripts. I can provide more information if you like.\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n\r\nNo breaking changes.\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\n  - Related feature request: godotengine/godot-proposals#2815 (closed by #97758, adding step-out to built-in debugger)\r\n  - Editor implementation: #97758 (merged Nov 14, 2025)\r\n  - DAP specification: https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/specification#Requests_StepOut\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.co